{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1790540751b4b40a184dcd5125d32e1d499ce04704f904c0efcf6ee93ede40b", "ja": "（美奈子は、新しい衣装の試着中。ふんわり可愛らしい\nデザインで、いい感じに仕上がったな！）", "zh": "（美奈子正在试穿新服装。设计蓬松可爱，成品效果相当不错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "b70a910112afeeeaa160ad4254c565299b660db082b62231f70d51cc78725658", "ja": "えへへっ。この衣装、とってもかわいいですね。\nふわふわしてる部分が、すごく気持ちいいんです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，这套服装特别可爱呢。\n蓬松的部分摸起来特别舒服♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "92a28377b1a88b6875cd913d453d90c1c8cfda54cb294712269ef035f9ddfa60", "ja": "{$P$}さんも触ってみてください！\n温かくて、幸せな気持ちになっちゃいますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也摸摸看吧！\n暖洋洋的，会让人感觉特别幸福哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1003_p", "source_sha256": "880f41115743142417e88b613e3d74e6e2ec2bc538c39c041542e5e5388ed7b0", "ja": "はは、気持ちだけもらっておくよ。\nまずは、衣装をキッチリ確認したいからな！", "zh": "哈哈，这份心意我就收下了。先让我好好确认一下服装吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "07477b6c31662d26259bca1a855a460b423be5d69e9a5d449151be2099852f21", "ja": "あっ、そうですね。この後もお仕事がありますし、\n温かくなって眠くなったら大変ですもんね！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。之后还有工作，\n要是身体暖和起来犯困了可就糟糕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "281b7f3552f1f2c85e3ff0e71c5350f2f71feb3b97f95cbd7c9b47059671fa28", "ja": "でも……{$P$}さんには、\nぽかぽか温まる時間も必要だと思いますよ？", "zh": "不过……我觉得，{$P$}先生也需要一段暖洋洋地放松一下的时间哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "309a80f6a56d1692919a7b0513a46f2e41685971f925110d09bf3822f753ea6e", "ja": "私たちのために、いつも頑張ってくれてるんですから。\nたまには、ゆっくり休むのも大切だと思うんです。", "zh": "您总是为了我们那么努力。\n我觉得偶尔好好休息一下，也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0f5b49ba316d6b1d6863e25c6c3639ff631ed5da671ba6294c16360dcd1f1c69", "ja": "心配してくれて、ありがとう。\n適度に休みをとってるから大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "谢谢你替我担心。\n我平时都有适度休息，所以没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1008_p", "source_sha256": "300fc1bb5b5b123e7d7f8396752900bf86aac148696f03d165a1d4e6830c6e3f", "ja": "それに、美奈子が、一生懸命アイドルしてる姿をみて、\nたくさん元気をもらってるし。", "zh": "而且，看着美奈子努力当偶像的样子，我也获得了很多活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "25a5573f934f20338bc0dbcc3e47080c1058c37148952201639bf121906e69d0", "ja": "……えへへ、それならよかったです♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿，那就太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "dbaabc7b8b4a65a5889bd9b89048f5dae47f9072cdf5c7f455f4569e58bd2f44", "ja": "でも、疲れた時は教えてくださいね。\n今の私なら、全部、癒してあげられる気がするんです！", "zh": "不过，累了的时候要告诉我哦。\n现在的我，感觉能治愈您的一切！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a1f280298881d1b2da7431228c83a2df376e3218488ec6cad713a3fd9e162f8e", "ja": "全部？", "zh": "全部？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "c575cf9e4028f52d40cec52a6583153e8da333de10b7aa55b0eab7fc34a77b59", "ja": "はい！　お腹はもちろん、\n心や体も温かさでいっぱいにしちゃいます！", "zh": "是的！当然不只是肚子，\n连内心和身体也要充满温暖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9ef67aba4c7b32e58f8af8298d31f5fadf93b24e36463c686cd0adc1c7368334", "ja": "おお、それは楽しみだな！　でも、その気持ちはまず\nファンの人達に向けてあげてほしい。", "zh": "哦哦，那可真让人期待啊！不过，这份心意，还是希望你先献给粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1014_p", "source_sha256": "117851688b2095a2ec69c131dd0f52cd00c385a8e69ab905b7062df6399f3ac6", "ja": "特別な何かをする必要はなくて……普段通り、ファンの\nためにパフォーマンスをしてほしいってだけだけどな。", "zh": "不需要做什么特别的事……我只是希望你像平时一样，为了粉丝们好好表演而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "f21baa05f0ac370892d391ce8795970ef6c0d5c4527f6ab53a20426526d72513", "ja": "それは任せてください♪　……私、どんなステージでも\n見てくれる人達に笑顔を届けようって思ってます。", "zh": "这就交给我吧♪……我想无论是什么舞台，都要把笑容带给前来观看的人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "9b15d8b21de31a25d66c2e028e2e1ba0c1a098a2e8d1f35fe9f115bf8b15b4f0", "ja": "笑顔だけじゃなくて、疲れてる時にはそっと寄り添った\nり……色々なやり方で支えられたらなぁって。", "zh": "不只是带给他们笑容，在他们疲惫的时候也能默默陪在身边……我希望能用各种各样的方式支持他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "e2df33d9169d7b52debcebad65ffb9a8bbe89d8a2c293d6a463404cf0b430c30", "ja": "体調次第で、必要な栄養も変わりますから。\n届けたい元気も、しっかり変えないと、ですよね♪", "zh": "根据身体状况不同，需要的营养也会有所变化。\n想要传递的活力，也得好好做出调整才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1018_p", "source_sha256": "deef74b3609709d71cbb06617a697a8c604b1f16f74d0a8ca711c6d137858545", "ja": "うん、元気の使い分けができたら、もっとたくさんの\n人達を元気にできると思う。よろしく！", "zh": "嗯，如果能根据情况灵活运用不同的活力，我想就能让更多人打起精神来。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "8ebf1ac49503a1966ae202298c9331ecd80b2a69b4a7c2d253ecad6c04a99b89", "ja": "ちなみに私としては、そのたくさんの人達の一番先頭に\n{$P$}さんがいますからね♪", "zh": "对我来说，那许许多多的人里，排在最前面的就是{$P$}先生哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "0c3fe3eb18ce7237fab259d5d7e8dffff5609476ba2352e5efb45ccf3cef53ab", "ja": "ずっと、元気や優しさをもらってきましたから。\nだから疲れたと思ったら、私を頼ってくださいね♪", "zh": "一直以来，我都从您那里获得了活力和温柔。所以如果您觉得累了，就请依靠我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0494_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b02fe7dfbc32bb647a007ca65a0dc66144ec3a1ec499d79d521829607a0e477a", "ja": "（持ち前の明るさと、相手の心に寄り添う形の癒し。\n美奈子の愛情は、もっと大きく……深くなりそうだな）", "zh": "（她与生俱来的开朗，以及贴近对方内心的治愈力。美奈子的爱，似乎会变得更加广博……更加深沉。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
